#. 被害者を目撃した人なら、他にもいたはずだよ？
#. そうだよね、<CLT 3>セレス<CLT>さん？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I believe someone else did see the victim before he\n"
"was murdered. What do you think, <CLT 3>Celeste<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. …そう言えば、そうでした。
#. わたくしが見ていましたわね。
msgctxt "0002 | CELES"
msgid "Now that you mention it, yes. I did see him."
msgstr ""

#. え？　マジですか？
msgctxt "0003 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Huh? Really?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、この話は苗木君にしか、
#. していませんでしたか…
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid "Oh, but I suppose only Makoto knows about this."
msgstr ""

#. では、みなさん知らなかったのですね？
#. ですから、醜く騒いでいらしたのですね？
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The rest of you had no idea, did you? That is why\n"
"you're all making such ugly noises."
msgstr ""

#. いいから、さっさと話したまえッ！！
msgctxt "0006 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Whatever, just hurry up and tell us!"
msgstr ""

#. 昨日の夜時間になる直前でした。
#. 不二咲…君を寄宿舎の<CLT 3>倉庫<CLT>で目撃したのです。
msgctxt "0007 | CELES"
msgid ""
"It was last night, right before nighttime. I saw\n"
"Chihiro...in the dormitory <CLT 3>warehouse<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲君はスポーツバッグの中に、
#. <CLT 3>ジャージ<CLT>などを詰め込んでおられました。
msgctxt "0008 | CELES"
msgid "I saw him stuffing a <CLT 3>track jacket<CLT> into a duffel bag."
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、その足でトレーニングに
#. 向かったのでしょう。
msgctxt "0009 | CELES"
msgid "And then, I assume, he headed off to exercise."
msgstr ""

#. スポーツバッグにジャージ…？
#. 現場に、そんな物は残されていなかったぞ！
msgctxt "0010 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"A track jacket and a duffel bag? But we didn't find\n"
"anything like that at the murder scene!"
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、犯人が処分したのだろう。
#. 証拠隠滅の為にな…
msgctxt "0011 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It seems likely that the culprit destroyed them to get\n"
"rid of any evidence..."
msgstr ""

#. その時なのですが…
#. 彼は、気になる言葉を口走っていたのです。
msgctxt "0012 | CELES"
msgid ""
"And that's when he said something that struck me as\n"
"rather odd..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…急いでるから行くね…
msgctxt "0013 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Well...I'd better get going. I'm kind of in a hurry."
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲君は、確かに<CLT 3>『急ぐ』<CLT>と言っていましたわ。
msgctxt "0014 | CELES"
msgid "Chihiro told me he was \"<CLT 3>in a hurry<CLT>.\""
msgstr ""

#. 急ぐという事は…<CLT 3>誰かと待ち合わせ<CLT>をしていた。
#. そうは考えられませんか？
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid ""
"But why would he be in a hurry? Only if someone were\n"
"<CLT 3>waiting for him<CLT>, I should think."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、不二咲千尋殿は誰かと待ち合わせをし、
#. その人物とトレーニングに向かったと…？
msgctxt "0016 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"So Mr. Fujisaki was on his way to meet with someone,\n"
"and then they were going to work out together...?"
msgstr ""

#. 我や朝日奈がいくら誘っても、
#. 一緒にトレーニングしようとはしなかったのにか…？
msgctxt "0017 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But Hina and I had invited him to exercise with us\n"
"plenty of times, and he always declined..."
msgstr ""

#. それは、正体がバレるのが、
#. 嫌だったからだろ？
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Probably cuz he was afraid you'd find out the secret\n"
"he was hiding, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 逆に言えば、待ち合わせをしていた人物は、
#. よほど信頼されていたのですね…
msgctxt "0019 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Which means that conversely, he must have trusted\n"
"whoever he was meeting with very much."
msgstr ""

#. 大事な秘密がバレても構わないと、
#. 思えるほどに…
msgctxt "0020 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Enough so that he was willing to risk his secret being\n"
"revealed..."
msgstr ""

#. うほほッ！　麗しき友情ねッ！！
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Uhuhu! What a marvelous friendship!"
msgstr ""

#. 要は、その待ち合わせ相手が犯人で、
#. それが誰なのかを突き止めればいいんだね！？
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"The point is, whoever he met up with is the culprit,\n"
"right? So we just gotta figure out who it was!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、これだけの手掛かりじゃ見当も…
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But knowing what we know, I can't even guess..."
msgstr ""

#. …付いているじゃない。
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...No, you already have what you need to make the\n"
"connection."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. もう犯人はわかってるじゃない…
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You know who the killer is."
msgstr ""

#. ほ、本当かッ！？
msgctxt "0027 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "S-Seriously!?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、誰だ！　誰が犯人だ！？
msgctxt "0028 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Wh-Who is it!? Who's the killer!?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人が処分したスポーツバッグやジャージに
#. 注目してみるのよ…
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Think back to the track jacket and duffel bag the\n"
"killer disposed of."
msgstr ""

#. その特徴から考えれば、
#. 彼が誰と会ったかは明白になるはずよ。
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Focus on the details of these items, and it should\n"
"become obvious who was waiting for him."
msgstr ""

#. …それは、本当なんですの？
msgctxt "0031 | CELES"
msgid "...Are you sure about that?"
msgstr ""

#. すでに処分された証拠から、犯人が判明するなんて…
msgctxt "0032 | CELES"
msgid ""
"You really think we can figure out who did it based on\n"
"two pieces of evidence that we don't have?"
msgstr ""

#. …まさか指紋を調べるとか？
msgctxt "0033 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"What, you wanna track down some fingerprints or\n"
"something?"
msgstr ""

#. 道具もないのに、素人の僕らには無理だ！！
msgctxt "0034 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Even if we had the equipment for that, we wouldn't\n"
"know how to use it!"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、証拠品はすでに処分されている。
#. 指紋を取るにも現物がなければどうしようもあるまい…
msgctxt "0035 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"As was noted, the evidence is already gone. There's\n"
"nothing to get fingerprints *from*."
msgstr ""

#. それでも<CLT 3>“推理”<CLT>なら出来るはずよ。
#. みんなで、よく話し合ってみればわかるわ…
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Maybe, but we *can* make certain <CLT 3>inferences<CLT>, if we\n"
"just take the time to talk it out."
msgstr ""

#. は、話し合ってみろって言われても…
msgctxt "0037 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Easy for you to say..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、セレスちゃんに聞くけど…
#. そのバッグやジャージには、何か<CLT 3>特徴<CLT>とかなかった？
msgctxt "0038 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But fine—Celeste, did you notice <CLT 3>anything special<CLT>\n"
"about the bag or jacket?"
msgstr ""

#. バッグは…倉庫にある<CLT 3>普通のバッグ<CLT>でしたわ。
msgctxt "0039 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The bag was...just a <CLT 3>normal duffel bag<CLT> from the\n"
"warehouse."
msgstr ""

#. 倉庫にあるバッグは、その１種類だけですし、
#. 特徴と言われましても…
msgctxt "0040 | CELES"
msgid ""
"All the bags in there are the same, so I can't imagine\n"
"what would make that one special..."
msgstr ""

#. 我の記憶によれば、
#. ジャージにはある程度の<CLT 3>種類<CLT>があったはずだ…
msgctxt "0041 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, if I remember right, there was a <CLT 3>decent\n"
"variety<CLT> of tracksuits to choose from..."
msgstr ""

#. …という事は、不二咲の持っていたジャージに、
#. 犯人に繋がる手掛かりがあるのではないか？
msgctxt "0042 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Do you think there might be some connection between\n"
"the culprit and Chihiro's jacket?"
msgstr ""

#. …だったら、彼が持っていた<CLT 3>ジャージ<CLT>について、
#. 話し合ってみましょうか？
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Perhaps. Let's explore that, and talk a bit more about\n"
"the <CLT 3>jacket<CLT> he took."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんが持ってたジャージに…
#. 犯人の手掛かりがあるなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does Chihiro's track jacket really hold some clue\n"
"about the killer?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって本当なのか…？
#. なんだか…信じられないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Somehow...it's really hard to believe...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
